      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--origin, -o</code></td>
        <td>İzin verilen istemci Origin/Referer adreslerinin virgülle ayrılmış listesi.</td>
        <td><code>"http://localhost:5173"</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--mode, -m</code></td>
        <td>Yayınlama modu: <code>direct</code> (anlık canlı) veya <code>draft</code> (taslak staging).</td>
        <td><code>"direct"</code></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td><code>--passphrase</code></td>
